# DevTools console greeting (web/console/index.ts). { $cmd } is replaced by mintaka.help().

console-hi = Hi, engineer. Type { $cmd } — or go straight for the first flag with mintaka.ctf()
console-help-help = this list
console-help-proof = fetch /_proof and log it
console-help-terminal = open the terminal (or press ~)
console-help-version = this build of the site, from /_proof
console-help-ctf = start the console challenge: four puzzles, then an application form
console-help-flag = check an answer to the current puzzle
console-help-apply = the application form, once all four puzzles are solved
